も不慮の事故で失ってしまい、天涯孤独の身となった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"謎めいた手紙に導かれ、女学園である財団法人「卯月美学園」に在籍することになったことから、女装での生活を余儀なくされる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18910","sourceWorkId":"10314","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"水瀬　雪兎（みなせ　ゆう）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"身長が低く童顔でかわいらしい。その為、女のコに間違われることが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人はそのことを気にしており、せめて身長を伸ばそうと日々努力をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"押しに弱くすぐ流されてしまう。気が優しくて思いやりのある子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に母『雪里（ゆり）』を亡くしており肉親親類の類は父『真兎（まなと）』のみだったが。しかし、その唯一の肉親である父をも事故で失いついに天涯孤独となる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女学園である卯月美学園（うつみがくえん）に在籍する為に女装での生活を余儀なくされる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"88959"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c4015f1bb81551fed063f6cf128111eed05566e2039fb9f463e50174dae4154.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/92c8cdc716322369fa01a549466cf2dc0034bcc02adf8ba2a23d4f4545f04640.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c53545","characterName":"桜木 美月","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"88960","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"206289"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18911"],"vndbCharacterId":"c53545"},"originalCharacterName":"桜木 美月","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"卯月美学園に通う二年生。主人公のクラスメイト兼、同寮生。小鳥遊柚々子の義姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口うるさいが、根は優しく面倒見の良い姉御肌。ただし自分の気持ちを素直に伝えるのが苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運動は出来るが、勉強は苦手らしく、クラスでもワースト3に入る出来の悪さ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天宮実里とは初等部から一緒で、何でも話し合える大親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"流されやすい主人公を情けないと思いながらも、何かと面倒を見てしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18911","sourceWorkId":"10314","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"桜木　美月（さくらぎ　みか）　CV：さくらはづき"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雪兎（ゆう）のクラスメイト兼同寮生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"運動は出来るが勉強はクラスでもワースト3に入る出来の悪さ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口うるさいが面倒見のいい姉御肌。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根が優しいが気持ちを素直に伝えるのが苦手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実里（みのり）とは初等部の頃からの付き合いで大の親友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"流されやすい性格の雪兎のことを情けないと思いながらもついつい面倒を見てしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義妹に柚々子（ゆゆこ）がいる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"88960"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18911","sourceWorkId":"10314","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18911","sourceWorkId":"10314","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18911","sourceWorkId":"10314","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18911","sourceWorkId":"10314","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26a432716c2a1bf6a9c3c7a84f7dc6e8a08af4f12e7e474c3d44e49587157189.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/eda3cf12ab9a150d9b878fde7f05b6b8220f8ac81776ef13c400f60a79d93cab.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"生天目仁美","creatorId":"vndb:s270","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s270","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s270","name":"生天目仁美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:206289:88960:4394:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c53546","characterName":"天宮 実里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"88961","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"206289"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18912"],"vndbCharacterI