なし　ゆゆこ）　CV：西野みく"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美月（みか）の義妹。雪兎（ゆう）たちの4つ下で中等部の2年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"甘やかされて育ってきた関係でわがまま。しかし、我を通そうとするわがままではなくどちらかと言うと甘えん坊な感じ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"したったらずなのですぐ手が出る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"必殺技は『ゆゆこぱんち』（身長が低く腕が短い為ぱんちといいつつ実はキック）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人見知りの気があり、意地が悪く見えるが素直ですぐだまされる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"義姉の美月のことを慕っており大のお姉ちゃん子。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"88966"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"75 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18916","sourceWorkId":"10314","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"149 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18916","sourceWorkId":"10314","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"79 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18916","sourceWorkId":"10314","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"52 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18916","sourceWorkId":"10314","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/165d42a40b63d29ec73f6fab0bf362133450435b2e04180152f1e1115bcde089.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/646e850934e1ac4878e79c348ac7834b761866f082677f2ea0db8cbe4de9118b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永田依子","creatorId":"vndb:s797","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s797","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s797","name":"永田依子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:206289:88966:5104:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61029","characterName":"天宮 巴","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"88967","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"206289"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18917"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61029"},"originalCharact